# LFS: the three committed .webp (the vendored Waveshare hero photos —
# composite/enclose inputs, docs/tools/*.webp — and sim_home.webp, the
# committed README hero) plus the static NASA ground truth under
# assets/images/moon/ (the SVS 4720 kit TIFs + the 36 SVS 5415
# gate/quarter frames; no other TIFs exist in the tree, and the docs
# media — screenshots/annot/composites/figs/NASA art/film — is gitignored
# build output regenerated by sphinx-build -b media (see
# docs/extensions/moonmedia.py); the docs/_graphs SVGs are tracked
# hand-authored text. The .tif rule dates from the 2026-11-26 SVS /vis/
# retirement: the NASA source data is proven static, so it ships with the
# repo instead of being re-downloaded from the internet.
*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tif  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
